Module
  name: game_lootburst
  description: Loot burst - (O677) the animation of the Loot Explosion: a flash on the death tile, every item flying in an arc with a soft shadow, a glow trail and a landing ring for Legendary, Divine, set and unique items, a dust puff where it lands; drawn as widgets over the map tiles (Tile:addOverlayWidget, base patch 0041) from the server's explode message on opcode 230 (game_groundlabels hands it here); switch in the Ground Labels window
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ lootburstlogic, lootburst ]
  dependencies:
    - game_interface
    - game_groundlabels
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1003
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
